&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;単元未満株式の買取り・売渡し&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
